{"availability":"available","full":"kadato/Dietinator","name":"Dietinator","description":"Local-first calorie tracker for Android, iOS, and web. SQLite diary, YAZIO food search, barcode scanning, meal builder, and on-device AI assistant. Built with Expo and React Native.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-29T10:47:52Z","updated":"2026-10-17T12:25:12Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"dietinator.pages.dev","topics":["android","calorie-tracker","expo","fitness","health","mcp","mcp-server","nutrition","offline-first","pwa","react-native","sqlite","typescript","yazio"],"demo":"https://dietinator.pages.dev/?demo=1","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:03.933Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:03.933Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:03.933Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:23:09.417Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-07T20:13:41.471Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-09T22:04:57.340Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-13T07:35:01.875Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T22:45:03.933Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Dietinator is a local-first calorie tracker. Diary entries live in SQLite on your device. Food search and optional sync use the unofficial YAZIO API. You need no account. The diary works offline.","No install, no account. Tap Explore the demo on the login screen."],"features":["Local-first diary. The app writes to diaryentries in expo-sqlite with WAL. The diary works fully offline. The food cache keeps past searches.","Dashboard. The dashboard shows a calorie ring, macro bars, and meal sections. It supports water and weight quick-add, copy of the previous day, and pull to refresh from YAZIO when you are online.","Food search. The search debounces YAZIO lookups. It shows category icons, favorites, and recents. It remembers serving sizes and amounts. Steppers support hold repeat. You see live budget impact before you save.","Meals. The builder stores reusable combos with auto nutrition math. Quick Add stores direct kcal and macros. Each meal has a budget and inline entry edit.","Barcode. The camera scans EAN and UPC on device with cache lookup. The scan is limited on web."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kadato/Dietinator/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b85e4da29bf28538aad9256c3d790248324f6d41171fe12a14db8a90f5aa5259","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:09.638Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:04.025Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Dietinator is a local-first calorie tracker. Diary entries live in SQLite on your device. Food search and optional sync use the unofficial YAZIO API. You need no account. The diary works offline.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kadato/Dietinator/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"You need no account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kadato/Dietinator/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"No install, no account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kadato/Dietinator/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"b85e4da29bf28538aad9256c3d790248324f6d41171fe12a14db8a90f5aa5259","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kadato/Dietinator/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:04.026Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-17T12:25:12Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kadato/Dietinator/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:04.026Z","hash":"b85e4da29bf28538aad9256c3d790248324f6d41171fe12a14db8a90f5aa5259","originalBytes":7637,"storedBytes":7637,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:03.933Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://dietinator.pages.dev/?demo=1","attemptedAt":"2026-10-18T23:06:04.524Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T23:06:04.524Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-18T23:06:04.524Z","target":"https://dietinat